#. Description of the plugin
#: store-insights-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Natural language to SQL query tool for WooCommerce. Uses your own AI provider key (OpenAI, Claude, OpenRouter, DeepSeek, Groq, Mistral, xAI, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint) to convert plain English questions into SQL queries against WooCommerce data."
msgstr ""

